OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe after Queen Victoria
OL,4,Apyramid cairn at Balmoral vandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a
OL,7,Fmemorial dedicated to Queen Victoria's
OL,8,Fhusband on the Balmoral Estate in
OL,9,FAberdeenshire was vandalised.
OL,11,FPrince Albert's Pyramid was
OL,12,Fcommissioned by Queen Victoria in
OL,13,Fmemory of her "beloved" husband, and
OL,14,Fwas completed in 1862.
OL,16,FIt is understood that graffiti was
OL,17,Fdiscovered, and it was reported at the
OL,18,Fweekend.
OL,20,FPolice Scotland confirmed the vandalism
OL,21,Fwas being investigated.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
